# On Sabbatical (crystalWar 32), the rivals at Gentle Tiger: a level 99 Warrior in Bastok Markets [S] (any job once it
# is accepted) with the WotG missions as group 1's flows. On Sabbatical accepted (a GM) at Prog 0, and the Bastok line
# accepted at Event steps (GMs): Fires of Discontent, Light in the Darkness, Burden of Suspicion, Quelling the Storm,
# Honor under Fire, Storm on the Horizon, What Price Loyalty, Beneath the Mask and The Truth Lies Hid. Gentle Tiger:
# On Sabbatical's 46 (a Progress) over every Event; finished: Prog 1; 47 twice. Then each Progress step of the line
# beside it, one at a time (GMs set the Prog): the tie of two Progress replies alternates, each trigger answering with
# the one that did not play last.
